Visually, "Python" stands out with its striking black and brassy gold finish. To overcome the high power-drain usually experienced during long flights, Tony over-engineered the suit's energy distribution systems, routing power directly from a high-capacity chest Arc Reactor to upgraded wing thrusters and leg stabilizers. It also carried extra micro-repulsor nodes across the limbs to maintain steady cruise speeds over thousands of miles without overheating.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XX deploys with the rest of the Iron Legion during the House Party Protocol at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis forces in air-to-ground combat before meeting its end in the final "Clean Slate" detonation.
